<BaseLayout title="Disclosures — Aeris Research" noindex={true}>
  <div class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="page-hero__content"><h1 class="page-hero__title">Disclosures</h1></div></div></div>
  <div class="about-page">
    <div class="about-section"><h2 class="about-section__title">Independence Disclosure</h2><div class="about-section__body"><p>Aeris Research LLC does not accept vendor sponsorship, paid placement, or consulting fees from companies it covers in research publications. Aeris analysts are prohibited from holding financial positions in publicly traded companies covered in their research. This independence policy is fundamental to the integrity of our research.</p></div></div>
    <div class="about-section"><h2 class="about-section__title">No Investment Advice</h2><div class="about-section__body"><p>Research and analysis published by Aeris Research is not investment advice. Aeris Research LLC is not registered as an investment adviser. Technology assessments reflect product and market conditions at the time of publication and may not reflect subsequent developments.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
